  <notes>
    Completed 2026-10-03. FindResultsList.tsx split into two independent sections (DocumentsSection,
    RecordsSection) inside one shared scroll container (no maxHeight cap); FindView.tsx no longer
    gates FindResultsList's mount on the documents fetch and dropped its own overflow:auto layer;
    useFindRecordMatches.ts's RecordMatch gained confidenceScore + matchReasons; App.tsx passes
    canOpenRecord to FindView. Open actions wired via a single onOpenRecord(entityType, recordId)
    callback to the existing openRecord launcher, gated on canOpenBrowserWindow + ORG_URL. Match
    reasons rendered via a new renderMatchReason parser (em -> bold, any other tag dropped, never
    dangerouslySetInnerHTML). Found and handled, client-side: a hub node's id is server-prefixed and
    the SameThread relationship's "thread-" hub carries no real record id — extractHubRecordId
    validates GUID shape before offering an open action, degrading safely to plain text otherwise.
    Gates: 3 Find suites 79/79 (was 57/57; +22 new tests); full gated jest 63/63 suites, 885/885
    tests; lint 0 errors/0 warnings on all touched files; typecheck 0 errors attributed to any file
    this task touched (project-wide count fluctuated 68->86->73 during the task because task 088 was
    concurrently mid-edit on SaveFlow.tsx/SaveView.tsx/the office-js mock in the same worktree - not
    this task's regression). Criterion 8 (live verification) left UNVERIFIED - no Office host in this
    worktree, same precedent as every prior Find task. Full detail: notes/092-find-tab.md.
  </notes>
</task>
